00:33:53.059 --> 00:33:57.140
for example. Just like the imagery and
demonstrating really the validity of

00:33:57.140 --> 00:34:01.240
your proposal is really important.

00:34:02.700 --> 00:34:04.866
[Erika] Then Sudha, did I see that...

00:34:04.866 --> 00:34:08.320
[Sudha] Actually, I
was going to say what Quinton just said that

00:34:08.329 --> 00:34:14.210
I totally agree with you. That part of
the scientific imaging is also evidence

00:34:14.210 --> 00:34:20.839
gathering. So, an image is also a piece of
really powerful evidence and it can

00:34:20.839 --> 00:34:28.010
demonstrate that you are able to
basically capture the process to some

00:34:28.010 --> 00:34:32.389
extent, for which you're asking money
already. So, it's also a piece of

00:34:32.389 --> 00:34:37.580
evidence and seeing is believing. So, yeah,
it helps.

