[Lina] Yeah, I really loved this photo, as well.
I'm so glad you picked it, Calvin.

00:36:51.710 --> 00:36:56.599
For me, what was really striking is
when you first look at it, you're like,

00:36:56.599 --> 00:37:00.049
"What is it?" and then, you know, you take a
