her image or she's a rice enthusiast.

00:49:31.940 --> 00:49:36.530
[Erika] Yes, I think this is Dora's image. Excellent. I
can't see the chat. I'm making sure

00:49:36.530 --> 00:49:41.240
my microphone is on and off. But, I can
see the clock and I see that we are

00:49:41.240 --> 00:49:45.320
almost at two o'clock and I think
all of us could go on and on and talk

00:49:45.320 --> 00:49:50.150
about what we love about images. There
are a couple questions about what you

00:49:50.150 --> 00:49:55.850
use to take your photos, what tools
you like for photography. Do you use your

